    "enUS": {
      "description": "I will fashion the cloth you've given me into bandages. In the meantime, please take these ones that I have already made, and dress the wounds of the soldiers who need it. It should be a matter of basic first aid.\r\n\r\nYour assistance here is both necessary, and highly appreciated. I simply cannot be everywhere at once.",
      "dialogue": {
        "fb38ea87a27e0f6ec9b5": "How fare the soldiers?"
      },
